For example, in characteristic 2 an `E`-key can have the form `x²−t^h`, which is irreducible but inseparable. The note’s actual splitting-type theorem begins:

> “Fix any disc ≠ 0 lift F”

Classification: **CLEAR-GENERAL after the frame correction**. The key field may be purely inseparable; the quartic polynomial whose splitting type is asserted is explicitly separable via `disc ≠ 0`.

**GH-2 — false stage-ring DVR assertion, already repaired.**

Frozen body:

